     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.	Scale-2- Very Partially (SDGs integrated in the mandate of existing coordination structures, but no new structures established)
1.2. Scale-2- Partially (SDG frameworks at national/sub-national level established but planning tools are not SDGs aligned) 
1.3-Scale-3- Moderate: (Stakeholders have decent understanding of SDGs)
